> 
> I would like to start netack with the option for auto-pickup off.
> I created ~/.nethackrc
> and put:
> autopickup=false
> 
> I also tried:
> autopickup=off
> 
> It have to turn it off manually.
> What's the correct syntax of this file?
> 
> Thank you

You could try:
  OPTIONS=!autopickup

or:
  OPTIONS=noautopickup

The main thing is to make sure you have the "OPTIONS=" part at the 
beginning.

Just FYI, you can also have multiple options on one line, like:
  OPTIONS=autopickup,pickup_types:$,pickup_burden:u

This turns autopickup for gold only, and only if it won't make you 
burdened (or worse).

For more info, you could try searching for "options" on the wiki, at 
http://nethack.wikia.com (I'd do it myself, but I'm having really wonky 
Internet right now--newsgroups and such work, but general web browsing 
is hit-and-miss).


